6. CHANGES TO YOUR MAC
At your request the Software reads battery and power information; replaces the macOS battery menu-bar item (hiding Apple's and restoring it when you quit or turn the option off); can change energy modes and Apple's charge limit, adjust screen and keyboard brightness and control the MagSafe charging light; quits other apps when you click their Quit button; and plays alert sounds. Energy modes and the charging light use a helper that runs with administrator privileges, installed only after you approve an administrator prompt. Battery forecasts, accuracy figures and savings estimates are estimates only and may be wrong — don't rely on them where running out of battery could cause harm or loss. You can undo these changes as described in the README's Uninstall section.

